                  "entry_id": "d:p:ella:2:151",
                  "kind": "observed"
                }
              ],
              "text": "I swept grass, beach and woods edges from the spring all morning and afternoon and never saw a single edible plant. Every 'gather' aimed at a tile failed with 'invalid target' — only things actually in sight can be gathered. Water at the spring (38,30) is the one resource I can rely on."
            },
