                },
                {
                  "entry_id": "d:p:ella:2:114",
                  "kind": "observed"
                }
              ],
              "text": "I tried to ask mia and ryan where food grows, but my words were never heard — they kept moving away before I got close enough. Speech only carries a short distance; I must be adjacent, not merely nearby."
            },
            "ref": "m:ella:250"
